# CDXC:ZmxPersistence 2026-05-20-09:57: Keep the Ghostex-managed zmx fork as a pinned submodule because native zmx pane refresh depends on a first-party zmx IPC protocol that older PATH installs do not implement.
[submodule "zmx"]
	path = .dependencies/zmx
	url = https://github.com/maddada/zmx.git
# CDXC:CrossPlatformExternalCheckout 2026-06-14-12:50: Keep the cross-platform Electron app outside this repository at `~/dev/prev/crossplatform` so the parent repo no longer pins or initializes it as a submodule.
# CDXC:CodeServerSubmodule 2026-06-07-11:20: Keep the embedded legacy code-server checkout under the Ghostex repo as a pinned fork submodule so the native code-server launcher resolves a reviewed Ghostex-specific branch instead of maintainer-local ~/dev/custom/code-server state.
[submodule "code-server"]
	path = .dependencies/code-server
	url = https://github.com/maddada/code-server.git
	branch = ghostex
[submodule "mobile"]
	path = apps/mobile/app
	url = https://github.com/maddada/ghostex-mobile.git
# CDXC:GPUIDependencies 2026-08-02: Keep external GPUI build inputs inside the
# Ghostex checkout. Gitlinks pin reviewed revisions, and the dependencies with
# Ghostex-owned runtime fixes use first-party fork branches so Actions can
# reproduce the exact source committed here.
# CDXC:Build 2026-11-06 DECISION: User chose to keep the GPUI stack on Zed main (first for the GPUI Fast 0.1.10 / GPUI Kit 0.8 upgrade, 2026-10-25), asked for the latest GPUI, GPUI Kit and GPUI Fast on 2026-11-03, and on 2026-11-06 picked the next sync: the zed fork carries GPUI Fast main 5bf7480 synced to Zed main 4a6121bb0f (GPUI Fast has not published a sync past Zed decd2399b1, so the fork does that sync itself with GPUI Fast's docs/upstream-sync.md), merged with the fork's commits over the GPUI Fast cd20d12 import; GPUI Kit is main b2aaa3e5 with the fork's commits; upstream's table cell selection change (#3813) stays out like the selection PRs of 2026-10-27, because the fork's Markdown tables and selection runs are its own, and the user asked (Q45, "Yes, port it") for the table row hover (#3812), which the fork ports to its own table layouts; GPUI Kit's scroll bounce stays on ("we judge it in testing"). This supersedes the 2026-11-03 note (GPUI Fast cd20d12 on Zed decd2399b1, GPUI Kit 4cbbc019).
[submodule ".dependencies/zed"]
	path = .dependencies/zed
	url = https://github.com/maddada/zed.git
	branch = ghostex
	ignore = dirty
[submodule ".dependencies/cef-rs"]
	path = .dependencies/cef-rs
	url = https://github.com/tauri-apps/cef-rs.git
	ignore = dirty
[submodule ".dependencies/gpui-component"]
	path = .dependencies/gpui-component
	url = https://github.com/maddada/gpui-component.git
	branch = ghostex
	ignore = dirty
[submodule ".dependencies/codex-swap"]
	path = .dependencies/codex-swap
	url = https://github.com/maddada/codex-swap.git
[submodule ".dependencies/wmx"]
	path = .dependencies/wmx
	url = https://github.com/maddada/wmx.git
# CDXC:AgentProviders 2026-11-07 DECISION: User (Q1680, Q1681): our build on top of claude-swap 1.0.0, on every OS for now; "i dont want to fork cswap". The fork's `ghostex` branch is upstream 1.0.0 plus realiti4/claude-swap#448 and #563, and gxserver installs its release wheel on macOS, Linux and Windows (server/src/accounts/claude_swap_build.rs). Remove this submodule once an upstream release carries both PRs. Supersedes the Windows-only build of 2026-10-16.
[submodule ".dependencies/claude-swap"]
	path = .dependencies/claude-swap
	url = https://github.com/maddada/claude-swap.git
	branch = ghostex
# CDXC:Browser 2026-11-07 DECISION: User (after a Discord tester said Annotate attaches no screenshot): "for g pls just fork agentation and add screenshot capturing but keep same tool and bundle it". Annotate runs Ghostex's fork of Agentation (`ghostex` branch, screenshot capture added), pinned here; `cargo xtask build-agentation` builds it into apps/desktop/vendor/agentation/agentation.generated.js, which the app bundles instead of loading Agentation from esm.sh.
[submodule ".dependencies/agentation"]
	path = .dependencies/agentation
	url = https://github.com/maddada/agentation.git
	branch = ghostex
